    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/bfabc864c8b403e325f59dc689b01aee.avif?t=1739665563\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span>And use your wits to fight dark forces which break the natural laws of reality itself.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This retro 90's style game will take you through space and time in an unforgettable cosmic horror experience.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the survivors and work together to defeat the greatest evil mankind has ever witnessed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.poster.avif?t=1739665563\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.webm?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.mp4?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/f0887099213ae80624b343f52e7ca418.avif?t=1739665563\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faithful 1990's game console art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, yet horrifying environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of a world ripped apart by nightmarish cosmic forces.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting atmosphere and original instrumental soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.poster.avif?t=1739665563\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.webm?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.mp4?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/bfabc864c8b403e325f59dc689b01aee.avif?t=1739665563\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span>And use your wits to fight dark forces which break the natural laws of reality itself.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This retro 90's style game will take you through space and time in an unforgettable cosmic horror experience.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the survivors and work together to defeat the greatest evil mankind has ever witnessed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.poster.avif?t=1739665563\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.webm?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/801eeb037b6ee1bd4e32b62725bed743.mp4?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/f0887099213ae80624b343f52e7ca418.avif?t=1739665563\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faithful 1990's game console art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, yet horrifying environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of a world ripped apart by nightmarish cosmic forces.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting atmosphere and original instrumental soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.poster.avif?t=1739665563\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.webm?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182950/extras/7c28d2486ce36ccda6e224a1e860b2a8.mp4?t=1739665563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2>",
    "short_description": "A time and space bending cosmic intelligence has found its way to Earth. Your family has been taken. Face the horrors of a twisted world and fight off the infected to save them. Travel through wormholes, explore nightmarish environments, solve cryptic puzzles, and run from demonic entities.",
